FreeCAD.GroupExtension.hasObject
hasObject(obj, recursive=false)
                Checks if the group has a given object
                @param obj        the object to check for.
                @param recursive  if true check also if the obj is child of some sub group (default is false).

Part.Ellipse.Focus1
The first focus is on the positive side of the major axis of the ellipse;
the second focus is on the negative side.

Part.Hyperbola.Focus1
The first focus is on the positive side of the major axis of the hyperbola;
the second focus is on the negative side.
